 ts and papers will be judged primarily on the quality of their econometric
 s content. We strongly encourage presentation and discussion of work in pr
 ogress. Papers already submitted to or accepted by journals are discourage
 d.\n\nFees for invited participants\n\n*A citizen residing in a country on
